POST http://localhost:3000/bowls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": "M",
  "base": "salad",
  "proteins": ["chicken"],
  "ingredients": ["avocado", "edamame", "tomato"],
  "quantity": 2
}
###

### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders

### Add a new order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "bowls": [1, 2],
  "totalPrice": 25.99,
  "status": "pending"
}

### Update order status
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### Delete an order
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1

### Get all bowls (for reference)
GET http://localhost:3000/bowls

### Get all shops
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shops

### Get availability
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availability

### Create a new shop
POST http://localhost:3000/api/shops
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Poke Heaven",
  "address": "123 Sushi Lane, Turin",
  "openingHours": {
    "monday":    "10:00-20:00",
    "tuesday":   "10:00-20:00",
    "wednesday": "10:00-20:00",
    "thursday":  "10:00-20:00",
    "friday":    "10:00-22:00",
    "saturday":  "11:00-22:00",
    "sunday":    "11:00-18:00"
  }
}
### Create 3 Regular bowls
POST http://localhost:3000/bowls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "size":"R", "base":"rice", "proteins":["tuna"], "ingredients":["avocado"], "quantity":3 }

### Create 2 Medium bowls
POST http://localhost:3000/bowls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "size":"M", "base":"salad", "proteins":["chicken","tofu"], "ingredients":["kale"], "quantity":2 }

### GET current availability
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availability

### Register new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpass123",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "fullName": "Test User"
}

### POST request to login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Clear all users
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clear-users


